  "id": "ismip/ismip7-gris-forcing",
  "title": "ISMIP7 Greenland Ice Sheet Forcing",
  "description": "Downscaled atmospheric and oceanic forcing data for the Greenland Ice Sheet, prepared for the ISMIP7 ice sheet model intercomparison project. It includes surface forcing derived from the CESM2-WACCM and MRI-ESM2-0 climate models (control, historical, and five SSP scenarios) at 1 km and 4 km resolution via three downscaling methods, ocean thermal forcing and salinity fields, and reanalysis-driven forcing from RACMO2.3p2-ERA and EN4.",
  "keywords": [
    "cryosphere",
    "climate",
    "meteorology",
    "oceanography",
    "atmospheric-data",
    "ice-sheet-modeling"
